This project is a non-commercial, fan-made derivative work based on the
light novel "Mitsuba Monogatari" (みつばものがたり, by Nanasawa Matari /
七沢またり), intended solely for enthusiast exchange. All rights to the
original work — including its characters, settings, plot, and names —
belong to the original author and the respective publishers; this
project asserts no rights over any original-work material.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
I. Nature of the Software
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

1. This project provides only a pure front-end (client-side) web
   application. It contains no artificial-intelligence model, generation
   service, or back-end program, and neither proxies nor provides any.

2. This project is a purely static web page, with no server-side program
   and no database. All user data — saves, chat logs, memory, API keys,
   and the like — is stored solely in the user's own browser on the
   user's own device; neither the author nor this project can collect,
   receive, or upload any such data.

3. The AI, image-generation, voice, and other interfaces required to run
   the game are configured by the user, and are connected directly from
   the user's browser to the third-party providers the user selects.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
II. Allocation of Responsibility
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

4. All AI behavior, and all of the user's input, output, and play
   activity, are produced independently by the user, who bears sole
   responsibility for them; they are unrelated to this project or the
   author.

5. The user must comply with all applicable laws and regulations of the
   user's jurisdiction, as well as the terms of the third-party providers
   used. The user bears sole responsibility for any consequences arising
   from the user's conduct or content.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
III. Restrictions on Use
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

6. Scraping, harvesting, crawling, or reverse-extracting any code, asset,
   or data of this project is prohibited.

7. Using this project or any part of it for any commercial purpose is
   prohibited.

8. Creating derivative works, rewriting, re-skinning, re-packaging, or
   redistributing based on the same architecture as this project is
   prohibited.

